            <ArticleTitle>Working in the emergency department.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2385-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In Finland, there is a trend towards joint regional emergency departments where emergency medicine specialists work together with physicians from specialties. This collaboration will benefit the care process management and patient care. Moreover, an observation unit is an essential part of the modern emergency department.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
